OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of heavy
OL,6,Frain in the early morning. This will
OL,7,Fsoon turn showery before becoming
OL,8,Fdrier with showers mostly restricted
OL,9,Fto the west and the north in the
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThe evening will be mostly
OL,13,Fdry with only a chance of an odd
OL,14,Fshower. The night will then continue
OL,15,Fdry with clear spells.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FDry with bright or sunny
OL,18,Fspells at first becoming cloudy with
OL,19,Fshowers, mainly in the south, from the
OL,20,Fearly afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
