OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FRain
OL,6,Fat times Monday, some heavy later.
OL,7,FScattered showers Tuesday. Showery
OL,8,Frain, some heavy or thundery spreads
OL,9,Feast Wednesday.
